<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM THE WESTERN OPEN, WON BY TIGER WOODS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM THE WESTERN OPEN, WON BY TIGER WOODS.</headline>
<dateline>LEMONT, Illinois 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>Sunday's final round of the $2 million Western Open played on</p>
<p>the 7,073-yard, par-72 Cog Hill course (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>275 Tiger Woods 67 72 68 68</p>
<p>278 Frank Nobilo (New Zealand) 71 70 67 70</p>
<p>279 Jeff Sluman 69 69 74 67, Justin Leonard 71 64 72 72,</p>
<p>Steve Lowery 70 72 66 71</p>
<p>280 Jim Furyk 67 74 67 72</p>
<p>281 Stuart Appleby (Australia) 71 72 70 68, Tom Watson 72 72</p>
<p>68 69, Jay Delsing 71 67 71 72, Steve Pate 75 67 67 72, Davis</p>
<p>Love 72 68 69 72, Loren Roberts 70 71 66 74</p>
<p>282 Tom Byrum 75 68 69 70, Andrew Magee 69 72 70 71, Scott</p>
<p>Hoch 71 68 71 72</p>
<p>283 Mark O'Meara 66 73 75 69</p>
<p>284 David Toms 71 71 73 69, Phil Blackmar 67 74 71 72, Mark</p>
<p>Calcavecchia 70 74 68 72, Billy Andrade 70 67 74 73</p>
<p>Other international players:</p>
<p>289 Rafael Alarcon (Mexico) 69 71 77 72</p>
<p>291 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 72 71 73 75</p>
<p>296 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 73 72 77 74</p>
</text>
